WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.800
Ryu remains down after the prerequisite heavy Mexican Typhoon.

2
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.300
Lily uses raw Drive Rush to approach the hard knockdown.

3
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:01.850
Ryu blocks the Rush crouching heavy punch.

4
00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:02.900
Ryu also blocks heavy Condor Wind.

5
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.000
Lily gains a Wind stock from the recorded pressure sequence.
